      <activity id="f8c36f05-a556-5946-8275-278cc08cf5af" activityNameId="5cb33965-e04a-521d-bcec-1895637fe2aa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Laminating, foil, with acrylic binder</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Laminating, foil, with acrylic binder
Data derived from: BUWAL 250, Ökoinventare für Verpackungen, Umwelt-Materialien Nr. 250, Bundesamt für Umwelt, Wald und Landschaft (BUWAL), Bern, 1996.;
UUID: b73dd0bf-3974-3459-b0f7-288fa24e7286
Estimation of electricity use for the laminating and cutting of foils. Only glue for laminating process included. Estimaion for waste process of glue overspray included. Materials which are laminated are not included. No transports of raw materials to the plant included. Infrastructure of the production plant not included.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (literature values).
Technology: Approximation from data of lamination of packaging foils. Acrylic glue as binder assumed.
Time period: Time of literature publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from Literature used 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b73dd0bf-3974-3459-b0f7-288fa24e7286.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
